# Assets to pack into the encrypted client asset archive (clientassets.pak).
#
# Each non-empty, non-comment line is a path or wildcard relative to the
# folder passed as -ResourcesPath. Wildcards are matched recursively.
#
# The pak namespace is the theme folder. Pack from a staging folder that
# contains the theme folder contents plus the client-only INIs (see the
# bellum-asset-pak skill for the staging workflow).
#
# Theme images (includes Icons/Sides/*.png and Campaign/Preview/*.png).
*.png

# Client-side INI files (theme, window layouts and game options).
# Do NOT add ClientDefinitions.ini, Renderers.ini, Fonts.ini,
# GameCollectionConfig.ini, FHCConfig.ini or UpdaterConfig.ini - those are read
# by the updater/game engine or before the packed-content provider is available.
DTACnCNetClient.ini
GlobalThemeSettings.ini
GameOptions.ini
GenericWindow.ini
MainMenu.ini
OptionsWindow.ini
CampaignSelector.ini
KeyboardCommands.ini
GameLobbyBase.ini
SkirmishLobby.ini
MultiplayerGameLobby.ini
CnCNetGameLobby.ini
CnCNetLobby.ini
CnCNetLoginWindow.ini
LANGameLobby.ini
LANLobby.ini
GameCreationWindow.ini
GameCreationWindow_Advanced.ini
GameLoadingLobby.ini
GameLoadingWindow.ini
LoadingScreen.ini
StatisticsWindow.ini
PrivateMessagingWindow.ini
PrivacyNotification.ini
ManualUpdateQueryWindow.ini
UpdateQueryWindow.ini
